# The three copy modes on one machine (F7: auto, the CPU, the blitter), a
# screenshot each: the frame is right in both layouts.
expect hello ST hello #1: machine
expect bench bench: new ST session
sleep 3
shot auto
key f7
expect cpu bench: copy mode CPU
sleep 3
shot cpu
key f7
expect blitter bench: copy mode BLITTER
sleep 3
shot blitter
